{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Taskbar Looters</strong> is a very simple idle game where you recruit animal looters to break open chests right on your desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Recruit Looters:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All you need to do is spend coins to recruit looters, and they will happily open chests for you automatically! However, no matter how badly they want to, they can't break open chests that are out of reach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Collect Treasures:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather coins and stars from chests! Use coins to unlock and recruit a variety of looters, and spend stars to upgrade them, making your looters stronger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Looters are Interactive:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each type of looter has its own reaction when clicked. Through interaction, you can help them find nearby chests\u2014or even distract them!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3527650?t=1742804140","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3527650?t=1742804140","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527650/cb8d430dd10f06b9763a11b453203957e3d14003/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742804140","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527650/cb8d430dd10f06b9763a11b453203957e3d14003/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742804140","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Taskbar Looters</strong> is a very simple idle game where you recruit animal looters to break open chests right on your desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Recruit Looters:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All you need to do is spend coins to recruit looters, and they will happily open chests for you automatically! However, no matter how badly they want to, they can't break open chests that are out of reach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Collect Treasures:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather coins and stars from chests! Use coins to unlock and recruit a variety of looters, and spend stars to upgrade them, making your looters stronger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Looters are Interactive:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each type of looter has its own reaction when clicked. Through interaction, you can help them find nearby chests\u2014or even distract them!</p>","developers":["B52"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527650/header.jpg?t=1742804140","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257097066,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257097066/movie480.mp4?t=1741099499","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257097066/movie_max.mp4?t=1741099499"},"name":"TaskbarLootersTrailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257097066/dbc7212c459e3293ed4fe60730cd3b46bc55fccd/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1741099499","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257097066/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1741099499","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257097066/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1741099499"}}],"name":"Taskbar Looters","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor